# Stale build output left by an earlier sandboxed run. Its files are owned by
# the CodexSandboxOffline account, so `vite build` could not empty dist/ and the
# current user cannot delete or rename the directory. It was renamed aside once
# so the build could proceed. Remove it from an elevated shell and delete this
# line:  takeown /f dist-stale-codex /r /d y  &&  rmdir /s /q dist-stale-codex
dist-stale-codex/
